                description="""A DNA sequencing assay that uses microfluidics to partition and barcode high molecular weight DNA such that short reads derived from fragments of the large piece of DNA can be assembled within the context of the high molecular weight piece of DNA they are derived from, facilitating the use of short read data to sequence and assemble large genomes.""",
